# Demo Repo

Start the app with `scripts/run.sh`; the old launcher `scripts/old_run.sh` is gone.

See the [setup guide](docs/setup.md#installation) and the [missing guide](docs/missing.md).
Also the [bad anchor](docs/setup.md#nope).
Jump [back to top](#demo-repo) or to the [same-doc ghost](#no-such-section).

```bash
./scripts/run.sh
./scripts/deploy.sh
```
